PANDAS 
it is the  python library that is used to anyzing the data, cleaning and explaining and manipulating the data 

pandas ----- "panel data" and "python data analysis" was created by Wes Mckinney in 2008

why we use?
pandas allws to analyze big dat and make conclusions based on statstical theories 

What Can Pandas Do?
Pandas gives you answers about the data. Like:

Is there a correlation between two or more columns?
What is average value?
Max value?
Min value?

--------------------------------------------------

Series:
A pandas series is like a column in a table 
it is one dimensional array data structure that hold any type.

in this values are labeled with their index number. index will be start with 0

custom label :
by using index keyword 

--------------------------------------------------

DataFrame :
Data set are usually in multi dimensional called dataframes

Series is like a column and dataframe is like a whole table 


loc: to return one or more specified row
when you want to give the custom index use index keyword

how to read the csv file --- df = pd.read_csv('data.csv')

1. csv (comma seperated values )file -- it contains plain text and seperated with commas or  big data sets 

2. Read Json 
JSON is a plain text in which it includes key values format data 
df = pd.read_json('data.json')
it contains the data llike python dictioneries 

